/-- **Common offset.** In the target order, slot `(i, h)` with `b ≤ h < b + qK` sits in the
`i`-th chunk of chunk group `j = ⌊(qK-1-(h-b))/K⌋`, at offset `ρ = (h-b) mod K` from the least
significant end of that chunk (position `K-1-ρ` inside it). -/
theorem tgt_slot (hK : 0 < K) (i : Fin D) {h : ℕ} (hb : bb ℓ K ≤ h) (hh : h < bb ℓ K + Synth.qq ℓ K * K) :
    let e := Synth.qq ℓ K * K - 1 - (h - bb ℓ K)
    (tgtL D ℓ K long).getD ((lstL D ℓ K long).length + ((e / K) * D + i) * K + (e % K)) 0 =
